WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.020
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.190
SPEAKER: What makes
something last?

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.870
Can it last if its mission
changes along the way?

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:10.000
Or would that make it
something different altogether?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.600
A thing only lasts when
its original purposes

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.880
remain intact.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.970
175 years ago,
Hillsdale College was

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:22.140
founded with a mission defined
by four enduring purposes--

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:26.490
learning, character,
faith, and freedom--

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.380
the same timeless mission
that guides its work today.

